--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party assets / Atribución de recursos de terceros
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT license above covers the HolAAC! source code only. It does NOT cover
the pictogram and audio assets bundled under `assets/`.

Pictograms (assets/pictos/) and their associated audio are the property of the
Government of Aragón (Gobierno de Aragón) and were created by Sergio Palao for
ARASAAC (https://arasaac.org). They are distributed under the Creative Commons
license BY-NC-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/):

  - Attribution: author Sergio Palao. Origin: ARASAAC (https://arasaac.org).
    Owner: Government of Aragón.
  - NonCommercial: the pictograms may not be used for commercial purposes.
  - ShareAlike: derivative works must be shared under the same license.

Los pictogramas son propiedad del Gobierno de Aragón, fueron creados por Sergio
Palao para ARASAAC y se distribuyen bajo licencia CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. El uso de la
aplicación es sin fines de lucro.
